{"help": "https://data.humdata.org/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"archived": false, "batch": "d5019248-cbd5-42fa-91e4-1696b3a8cb2d", "caveats": "The following geographical caveats may not completely agree with the COD-PS metadata provided by UNFPA (found in the Metadata tab of the gha_admpop_2021.xlsx spreadsheet).\r\n\r\nThe COD-AB consolidates the following sub-metropolitan areas found in this COD-PS dataset:\r\n\r\n\"KMA-Bantama\", \"KMA-Manhyia\", \"KMA-Manhyia South\", \"KMA-Nhyiaeso\", and \"KMA-Subin\" are consolidated into \"Kumasi Metropolitan\" [GH0228]\r\n\"CCMA-Cape Coast North\" and \"CCMA-Cape Coast South\" are consolidated into Coast Metropolitan [GH0511]\r\n\"AMA-Ablekuma South\", \"AMA-Ashiedu Keteke\", and \"AMA-Okaikoi South\" are consolidated into \"Accra Metropolis\" [GH0704]\r\n\"TMA-Tema Central\" and \"TMA-Tema East\" are consolidated into \"Tema Metropolitan\" [GH0727]\r\n\"TMA-Tamale Central\" and \"TMA-Tamale South\" are consolidated into \"Tamale Metropolitan\" [GH0812]\r\n\"STMA-Essikado-Ketan\", \"STMA-Sekondi\", and \"STMA-Takoradi\" are consolidated into \"Sekondi Takoradi Metropolis\" [GH1508]\r\n\r\nThe COD-AB excludes Guan district (census population 28,238) which was created in 2021 from Hohoe district [GH1410].  However, although Hohoe district is in Volta region [GH14], Guan was made a part of an enlarged Oti region [GH10].  \r\n\r\nThe gha_admpop_2022.xlsx spreadsheet and associated .csv files handle the above discrepancies in the folllowing manner:\r\n\r\n1)  The spreadsheet includes the following tabs:\r\n\r\nThe complete census population data is found in the 'gha_admpop_adm2PS_2022' tab (272 data records) including the following fields:\r\n'ADM2_PCODE' from the COD-AB, containing duplicates in the case of consolidations detailed above;\r\n'ADM2_EN_PS' containing the census source district names;\r\n'ADM2_EN' containing the corresponding COD-AB district name field with duplicates for the metropolitain consolidations names detailed above above and 'Hohoe' instead of 'Guan'.\r\nThis table is not represented by a .csv file.\r\n\r\n2)  The census population data aligned to the COD-AB administrative level 2 layer is found in the 'gha_admpop_adm2_2022' tab (260 data records).   This table is also represented in the 'gha_admpop_adm2_2022.csv' file.\r\n\r\n3)  The census population data aligned to the COD-AB administrative level 1 layer is found in the 'gha_admpop_adm1_2022' tab (16 data records).  This table assigns the population of Guan district to the Oti region record even though Guan district was created from the Volta region.  In this way the Oti and Volta polygons may be mapped with their census populations although the COD-AB is thought to have become slightly incorrect.  This table is also represented in the 'gha_admpop_adm1_2022.csv' file.\r\n\r\nThe 'gha_admpop_adm0_2022' tab and 'gha_admpop_adm0_2022.csv' file are not influenced by these caveats.\r\n", "cod_level": "cod-enhanced", "creator_user_id": "9429fda5-d84f-42e4-890d-e03bf8297f7b", "data_update_frequency": "365", "dataset_date": "[2021-01-01T00:00:00 TO 2021-12-31T23:59:59]", "dataset_preview": "first_resource", "dataset_source": "UNFPA", "due_date": "2022-12-31T23:59:59", "has_geodata": false, "has_showcases": false, "id": "d618e616-dfbc-4993-9eac-0b484b5cd2b4", "is_requestdata_type": false, "isopen": false, "last_modified": "2024-01-19T19:22:16.503950", "license_id": "cc-by-igo", "license_title": "Creative Commons Attribution for Intergovernmental Organisations (CC BY-IGO)", "license_url": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/legalcode", "maintainer": "198f456b-7afb-40c8-b368-62c5a34822e0", "metadata_created": "2021-06-18T11:14:31.196184", "metadata_modified": "2026-04-14T10:42:06.759785", "methodology": "Other", "methodology_other": "See 'Metadata' tab in spreadsheet", "name": "cod-ps-gha", "notes": "Ghana administrative level 0-2 age and sex disaggregated 2021 population statistics\r\n\r\nSee caveats\r\n\r\nThese tables are suitable for database and GIS linkage to the [Ghana - Subnational Administrative Boundaries](https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-gha).", "num_resources": 5, "num_tags": 1, "organization": {"id": "95aa8d05-b110-4607-9330-f2a779885493", "name": "unfpa", "title": "UNFPA", "type": "organization", "description": "UNFPA, the United Nations Population Fund, works globally to ensure universal access to sexual and reproductive health, prevent and respond to gender-based violence, collect and use population data, and promote gender equality and the empowerment of women and youth across the humanitarian/development continuum.", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-03-28T16:36:48.790190", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "95aa8d05-b110-4607-9330-f2a779885493", "package_creator": "haythornthwaite_un", "pageviews_last_14_days": 48, "private": false, "qa_completed": false, "solr_additions": "{\"countries\": [\"Ghana\"]}", "state": "active", "subnational": "1", "title": "Ghana - Subnational Population Statistics", "total_res_downloads": 3691, "type": "dataset", "updated_by_script": "HDXINTERNAL:HDXPythonLibrary/6.2.1-CODs (2024-01-18T21:57:15.886294)", "url": null, "version": null, "groups": [{"description": "", "display_name": "Ghana", "id": "gha", "image_display_url": "", "name": "gha", "title": "Ghana"}], "resources": [{"alt_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/d618e616-dfbc-4993-9eac-0b484b5cd2b4/resource/31c4e4c6-529c-4559-8650-3d994219196d/download/", "cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2021-06-18T11:46:19.207562", "datastore_active": false, "description": "Ghana administrative level 0-2 gazetteer", "download_url": "https://data.humdata.org/dataset/d618e616-dfbc-4993-9eac-0b484b5cd2b4/resource/31c4e4c6-529c-4559-8650-3d994219196d/download/gha_adminboundaries_tabulardata.xlsx", "format": "XLSX", "fs_check_info": "[{\"state\": \"processing\